<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Intel rises 1-3/8 to 103.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Intel rises 1-3/8 to 103.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Intel Corp rose 1-3/8 to 103 in after hours trade to Tuesday, in response to bullish book-to-bill figures, traders said.</p>
<p>Shares of Micron Technology Inc were up 7/8 to 32-3/8.</p>
<p>Activity was light for other issues, traders said.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said that Marvel Entertainment Group Inc, Three-Five Systems Inc and Tech-Sym Corp were unavialable for after hours trade for news.  </p>
<p>The NYSE said that session one volume was 11,500 shares, compared to 1,100 shares Monday. Session two volume was 397,051 shares versus 1,141,068 Monday.</p>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said there was no after-hours activity.</p>
